    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "9f4e4d031596901891b9": "Yesh, it'sh true, I'm blind as a bat! An' drunk as a ... err, drunk as shomething that getsh drunk.$B$BI'll tell you what, $r. It'sh the drink that keeps me shenses sharp. It'sh common knowledge that when you lose a shense, yer other shenses become more alert. My drunk shense is incredible these days."
      },
      "name": "Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker",
      "subName": "The Thorium Brotherhood",
      "translationMetadata": {
